# Artifacts are hashed by sha256 and those hashes are recorded in
# artifacts/baseline/frozen_baseline.json. Git's end-of-line conversion would
# change the bytes per platform and therefore change the hash: a clone on Linux
# got LF and hashed 691030e2..., while the frozen record says 48983573... (CRLF),
# so scripts/train_grpo.py's verification REFUSED to train. Never convert these.
artifacts/** -text
